          "short": "5 faces; a square pyramid.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5-8+F&=2\\\\F-3&=2\\\\F&=5\\end{align*}$$\n\nA square pyramid has one square base and four triangular faces, with 8 edges and 5 vertices.",
