          "short": "5 faces; a triangular prism.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}6-9+F&=2\\\\F-3&=2\\\\F&=5\\end{align*}$$\n\nA triangular prism has two triangular faces and three rectangular faces, with 9 edges and 6 vertices.",
